    {
      "id": "6aa15e2b84090a882402b9c4",
      "text": "DO-GU",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15ea30000000000271f5f",
      "text": "> お気に入りの作業道具を、見せ合う",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960420,
      "updated": 1788960422
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15ea50000000000271f60",
      "text": "> 道具の入れ替わりが激しい今だから、みんながどんな道具を使っているのか気になります。 自分の道具遍歴をまとめておきたくもなります。面倒な手入力はありません。 あなたのいつものエージェントに頼んで、あなたの道具をまとめてみませんか？",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960422,
      "updated": 1788960422
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e990000000000271f5e",
      "text": "https://do-gu.niwa.dev",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960410,
      "updated": 1788960410
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e3e0000000000271f47",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e3e0000000000271f48",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e3e0000000000271f49",
      "text": " https://do-gu.niwa.dev/@inajob",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e3e0000000000271f4a",
      "text": " \tおお、面白そうだ、[DO-GU][sta.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e3e0000000000271f4b",
      "text": "\t\tコーディングエージェントがが環境をまさぐってデータを送信する作りが面白かったです[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e3e0000000000271f4c",
      "text": "\t\t\t怖いと言えば怖い",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960319,
      "updated": 1788960319
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e610000000000271f4d",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960355,
      "updated": 1788960356
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e630000000000271f4e",
      "text": "[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960356,
      "updated": 1788960356
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e630000000000271f50",
      "text": "\t[DO-GU]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960356,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f51",
      "text": "\t\thttps://do-gu.niwa.dev/decks",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f52",
      "text": "\t\t結構知ってる人いるなぁ",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f53",
      "text": "\t\thttps://do-gu.niwa.dev/@catnose99",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f54",
      "text": "\t\t\tシンプルだ、12 tools",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f55",
      "text": "\t\thttps://do-gu.niwa.dev/@Nicolas0315",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f56",
      "text": "\t\t\tたぶん一番多い人、192 tools",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f57",
      "text": "\t\t[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f58",
      "text": "\t\t\tさて、windowsだとどうなるかな",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f59",
      "text": "\t\t\thttps://do-gu.niwa.dev/@stakiran",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f5a",
      "text": "\t\t\tフリーソフトも結構拾ってくれる",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f5b",
      "text": "\t\t\t\tああ、個人的に安全対策でbashの自動承認はオフってるから一部エラーが出てる説（Zoomとか検出されてないし）",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f5c",
      "text": "\t\t\tPATH通してるだけのコマンド等はデフォでは通さない（ので自分で指定する必要あり）",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
    {
      "id": "6aa15e7a0000000000271f5d",
      "text": "\t\t\t>新規作成になったのは秀丸エディタ、ConEmu、TortoiseGit、vsce、n8n、Bandicam、MPC-HC、LICEcap、CLaunch、Tablacus Explorer、TreeSize の11件です。これらのアイコンは未設定のままです。",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1788960379,
      "updated": 1788960379
    },
